{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Pine Hollow Trailer Park</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Six trailers. One newcomer. And a nightly visitor no one dares to speak of.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've just moved in. During the day, life seems ordinary: take out the trash, fix the wiring, chat with neighbors on their porches. The people here are strange, but friendly\u2026 until night falls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Something comes every night.</strong><br>The lights flicker. Sirens echo through the fog. Silhouettes appear outside the window. Scratching at the door.<br>The TV turns on by itself.<br>And by morning \u2014 one neighbor might be gone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one wants to talk about it. But you can feel it: <strong>he\u2019s real</strong>.<br>He\u2019s watching.<br>He\u2019s close.<br>And each night, he gets closer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological VHS/PSX-style horror</strong> in first person</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus on <strong>atmosphere and exploration</strong>, not combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each night grows more tense</strong> as neighbors begin to disappear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One trailer park. Six residents. <strong>And something stalking in the fog</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For fans of <i>Paratopic</i>, <i>Lost in Vivo</i>, <i>Fear the Spotlight</i>, <i>Mundaun</i></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3826840?t=1758551194","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826840/1368f8a1e9bfbc3ba9c32863d3480a15933df8e6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758551194","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826840/e4c93eac5b62511f137ea1946c2dd53a19138b21/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758551194","capsule_